          "en": "that holds that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 426.15,
          "end": 430.89,
          "en": "To be precise, you have to add the use client directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 430.89,
          "end": 434.64,
          "en": "and that then allows you to use client site features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 434.64,
          "end": 436.32,
          "en": "in your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 436.32,
          "end": 440.82,
          "en": "Like event handlers or use effect and use state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 440.82,
          "end": 441.78,
          "en": "So therefore here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 441.78,
          "end": 445.23,
          "en": "in order to make this slideshow component work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 445.23,
          "end": 448.71,
          "en": "we have to add this use client directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 448.71,
          "end": 450.423,
          "en": "at the top of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 452.58,
          "end": 456.15,
          "en": "And with that added, we can go back to that main page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 456.15,
          "end": 458.22,
          "en": "and bring back that import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 458.22,
          "end": 460.383,
          "en": "and bring back that component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 462.09000000000003,
          "end": 465.39,
          "en": "And now you will see that if you reload, this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 465.39,
          "end": 467.43,
          "en": "we no longer get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 467.43,
          "end": 469.29,
          "en": "and we now have that image here",
